                  _L_O_C_K_D_I_R
                        Alternate way to specify the locking directory.

                  _L_O_G_D_I_R
                        Alternate way to specify the logging directory.

                  _L_O_G___U_S_E_R
                        User for all log files if possible (defaults to
                        _b_u_i_l_d___u_s_e_r).

                  _M_I_R_R_O_R
                        Applicable to fetch modes.  If 0, will only fetch nor‐
