                  _N_E_V_E_R___C_L_E_A_N
                        If 1, ddppbb will never clean any work directory after
                        build.

                  _N_O___B_U_I_L_D___S_T_A_T_S
                        Disable reading/saving of default build stats under
                        _$_{_D_I_S_T_D_I_R_}_/_b_u_i_l_d_-_s_t_a_t_s_/_$_{_A_R_C_H_}.

                  _N_O___C_H_E_C_K_S_U_M
                        Do not run _c_h_e_c_k_s_u_m again for files already fetched.

                  _N_O___C_U_R_S_O_R
                        Make the terminal cursor invisible if possible.
                        Avoids flickering on slow graphics cards.

                  _N_O___H_I_S_T_O_R_Y
