                        first run.

                  _N_O___Q_U_I_C_K___S_C_A_N
                        Disable the quick scan default heuristic, where full
                        bulks will start by scanning the most prominent ports
                        in former builds.

                  _P_O_R_T___U_S_E_R
                        User that can write to the ports tree.  Not really
                        used for anything yet.

                  _R_E_C_O_R_D
                        Define a file which will save all terminal output.
                        Mostly useful for presentations, as a way to save ddppbb
                        output and replay it later at a faster rate.  Defaults
                        to _%_L_/_t_e_r_m_-_r_e_p_o_r_t_._l_o_g, can be set to nothing to dis‐
                        able.

                  _S_T_A_R_T_U_P
